      "description": "The future is here. Are you listening? A youth-led exhibition by national charity, Artswork This youth-led exhibition brings together bold, honest and imaginative responses from young people to some of the most pressing challenges of our time, including: Mental health and wellbeing Climate and environmental responsibility Community cohesion and belonging Youth unemployment, skills and future opportunity Through visual arts, film, sound and word, Hope uses creativity as a catalyst – sparking dialogue, inviting shared responsibility and inspiring action. Young people are not contributing to a pre-written story. They are the authors. They bring insight, solutions, resilience, leadership and imagination to the table, and HOPE gives them the platform to be seen, heard and understood.",
      "ends_at": "2027-01-23T00:00:00Z",
