      "description": "\n                    <h4><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><strong>The future is here. Are you listening?&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><strong>A youth-led exhibition by national charity,&nbsp;Artswork</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">This&nbsp;youth-led&nbsp;exhibition brings together bold,&nbsp;honest&nbsp;and imaginative responses from young people to some of the most pressing challenges of our time,&nbsp;including:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">\n<li><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Mental health and wellbeing&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Climate and environmental responsibility&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Community cohesion and belonging&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Youth unemployment,&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and future opportunity&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Through visual arts, film, sound and word, Hope uses creativity as a catalyst – sparking dialogue, inviting shared responsibility and inspiring action.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">Young people are not contributing&nbsp;to a pre-written story.&nbsp;They are the authors.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Poppins;\">They bring insight, solutions, resilience, leadership and imagination to the table, and HOPE gives them the platform to be seen,&nbsp;heard&nbsp;and&nbsp;understood.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n                ",
